+### Account e-mails
+
+- **Password reset request** (`/forgot-password`, guests only): the answer is identical whether or not the address has an account, and only registered addresses receive the link. Requests are throttled to 6 per minute.
+- **New password** (`/reset-password`): the token must match the e-mail; the password has at least 8 characters with upper and lower case letters and numbers, and must be confirmed. A successful reset rotates the remember token and fires `PasswordReset`.
+- **E-mail verification** (`/email/verify/{id}/{hash}`): signed, expiring, throttled. It verifies only the logged-in user whose id and e-mail hash match the link; anything else is 403.
+- Account e-mails are rendered in pt-BR with the `pegafila` mail theme (`resources/views/vendor/mail/html/themes/pegafila.css`).
+
